{"id":"vol9-07","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-07/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":374.26,"segments":[{"start":1.81,"end":6.23,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 25.","words":[["Now",1.81,2.43],["listen",2.43,2.81],["carefully",2.81,3.27],["and",3.27,3.67],["answer",3.67,4.09],["questions",4.09,4.53],["21",4.53,5.35],["to",5.35,5.63],["25.",5.63,6.23]]},{"start":9.45,"end":10.65,"text":"Dr Rubin?","words":[["Dr",9.45,10.21],["Rubin?",10.21,10.65]]},{"start":11.15,"end":16.25,"text":"Hello Jack. So have you chosen which artist you're going to give your presentation on?","words":[["Hello",11.15,11.51],["Jack.",11.51,11.97],["So",12.67,12.95],["have",12.95,13.15],["you",13.15,13.25],["chosen",13.25,13.69],["which",13.69,13.93],["artist",13.93,14.45],["you're",14.45,14.83],["going",14.83,14.97],["to",14.97,15.13],["give",15.13,15.27],["your",15.27,15.39],["presentation",15.39,15.77],["on?",15.77,16.25]]},{"start":16.75,"end":21.11,"text":"Yes, Samuel Prout, the 19th century English watercolor painter.","words":[["Yes,",16.75,17.09],["Samuel",17.47,17.75],["Prout,",17.75,18.23],["the",18.61,18.69],["19th",18.69,19.65],["century",19.65,19.65],["English",19.65,19.99],["watercolor",19.99,20.49],["painter.",20.49,21.11]]},{"start":21.65,"end":27.49,"text":"Right, interesting choice. I always feel he never quite got the fame he deserved, did he?","words":[["Right,",21.65,22.13],["interesting",22.53,22.99],["choice.",22.99,23.43],["I",24.19,24.41],["always",24.41,24.65],["feel",24.65,24.87],["he",24.87,25.01],["never",25.01,25.23],["quite",25.23,25.59],["got",25.59,25.83],["the",25.83,25.97],["fame",25.97,26.31],["he",26.31,26.51],["deserved,",26.51,27.03],["did",27.17,27.27],["he?",27.27,27.49]]},{"start":27.49,"end":33.27,"text":"No, I think that's true. I mean, I don't think he ever went completely out of vogue, even","words":[["No,",27.49,28.03],["I",28.17,28.25],["think",28.25,28.41],["that's",28.41,28.75],["true.",28.75,29.05],["I",29.81,30.01],["mean,",30.01,30.13],["I",30.29,30.45],["don't",30.45,30.69],["think",30.69,30.83],["he",30.83,31.01],["ever",31.01,31.15],["went",31.15,31.39],["completely",31.39,31.97],["out",31.97,32.37],["of",32.37,32.55],["vogue,",32.55,32.85],["even",33.01,33.27]]},{"start":33.27,"end":38.79,"text":"though tastes and fashions come and go. He was really prolific in his day, but there's","words":[["though",33.27,33.49],["tastes",33.49,33.85],["and",33.85,34.07],["fashions",34.07,34.55],["come",34.55,34.87],["and",34.87,35.03],["go.",35.03,35.29],["He",36.15,36.37],["was",36.37,36.51],["really",36.51,36.73],["prolific",36.73,37.29],["in",37.29,37.57],["his",37.57,37.77],["day,",37.77,38.11],["but",38.23,38.43],["there's",38.43,38.79]]},{"start":38.79,"end":43.95,"text":"never really been a high profile showing of his paintings. That could have brought him","words":[["never",38.79,39.01],["really",39.01,39.41],["been",39.41,39.65],["a",39.65,39.79],["high",39.79,40.03],["profile",40.03,40.49],["showing",40.49,41.03],["of",41.03,41.27],["his",41.27,41.41],["paintings.",41.41,41.89],["That",42.57,43.13],["could",43.13,43.31],["have",43.31,43.47],["brought",43.47,43.69],["him",43.69,43.95]]},{"start":43.95,"end":45.19,"text":"to more people's attention.","words":[["to",43.95,44.09],["more",44.09,44.35],["people's",44.35,44.79],["attention.",44.79,45.19]]},{"start":45.69,"end":51.97,"text":"Sure. But I think it's remarkable that he achieved any critical success given the","words":[["Sure.",45.69,46.09],["But",46.81,47.09],["I",47.09,47.53],["think",47.53,47.83],["it's",47.83,48.25],["remarkable",48.25,48.77],["that",48.77,49.37],["he",49.37,49.61],["achieved",49.61,50.01],["any",50.01,50.37],["critical",50.37,50.85],["success",50.85,51.37],["given",51.37,51.75],["the",51.75,51.97]]},{"start":51.97,"end":56.95,"text":"problems that he had. Apparently he was prone to chronic chest infections throughout","words":[["problems",51.97,52.39],["that",52.39,52.71],["he",52.71,52.85],["had.",52.85,53.15],["Apparently",53.87,54.31],["he",54.31,54.53],["was",54.53,54.69],["prone",54.69,54.93],["to",54.93,55.13],["chronic",55.13,55.49],["chest",55.49,55.87],["infections",55.87,56.49],["throughout",56.49,56.95]]},{"start":56.95,"end":62.53,"text":"his life. Yes, it must have been hard for him, but it seems he had a loving wife","words":[["his",56.95,57.31],["life.",57.31,57.77],["Yes,",58.07,58.33],["it",58.49,58.63],["must",58.63,58.81],["have",58.81,58.97],["been",58.97,59.11],["hard",59.11,59.43],["for",59.43,59.71],["him,",59.71,59.99],["but",60.47,60.81],["it",60.81,61.07],["seems",61.07,61.37],["he",61.37,61.61],["had",61.61,61.79],["a",61.79,61.89],["loving",61.89,62.13],["wife",62.13,62.53]]},{"start":62.53,"end":67.91,"text":"and family. And a strong network of colleagues and supporters. Yeah, I've","words":[["and",62.53,62.79],["family.",62.79,63.19],["And",63.45,63.95],["a",63.95,64.19],["strong",64.19,64.47],["network",64.47,64.97],["of",64.97,65.23],["colleagues",65.23,65.61],["and",65.61,65.95],["supporters.",65.95,66.49],["Yeah,",66.99,67.37],["I've",67.67,67.91]]},{"start":67.91,"end":71.21,"text":"been trying to find out what got him interested in painting in the first","words":[["been",67.91,68.07],["trying",68.07,68.35],["to",68.35,68.53],["find",68.53,68.77],["out",68.77,68.99],["what",68.99,69.17],["got",69.17,69.35],["him",69.35,69.55],["interested",69.55,69.95],["in",69.95,70.25],["painting",70.25,70.59],["in",70.59,70.85],["the",70.85,70.95],["first",70.95,71.21]]},{"start":71.21,"end":75.81,"text":"place. He doesn't seem to have learned the skill from his father, like so many","words":[["place.",71.21,71.63],["He",72.21,72.39],["doesn't",72.39,72.71],["seem",72.71,72.93],["to",72.93,73.15],["have",73.15,73.29],["learned",73.29,73.53],["the",73.53,73.71],["skill",73.71,73.97],["from",73.97,74.17],["his",74.17,74.37],["father,",74.37,74.79],["like",75.15,75.37],["so",75.37,75.61],["many",75.61,75.81]]},{"start":75.81,"end":81.73,"text":"artists of his time. No, well I think he painstakingly reproduced other","words":[["artists",75.81,76.37],["of",76.37,76.55],["his",76.55,76.71],["time.",76.71,77.05],["No,",77.75,78.25],["well",78.61,78.75],["I",78.75,79.15],["think",79.15,79.37],["he",79.37,79.57],["painstakingly",79.57,80.67],["reproduced",80.67,81.45],["other",81.45,81.73]]},{"start":81.73,"end":88.33,"text":"painter's works, essentially sort of schooling himself. And then later on he actually became","words":[["painter's",81.73,82.29],["works,",82.29,82.57],["essentially",83.27,83.73],["sort",83.73,84.09],["of",84.09,84.35],["schooling",84.35,84.83],["himself.",84.83,85.31],["And",86.15,86.35],["then",86.35,86.51],["later",86.51,86.79],["on",86.79,87.09],["he",87.09,87.35],["actually",87.35,87.83],["became",87.83,88.33]]},{"start":88.33,"end":93.23,"text":"an art teacher. How do you feel about Prout's style of painting?","words":[["an",88.33,88.69],["art",88.69,89.01],["teacher.",89.01,89.47],["How",90.31,90.59],["do",90.59,90.73],["you",90.73,90.85],["feel",90.85,91.23],["about",91.23,91.51],["Prout's",91.51,92.15],["style",92.15,92.65],["of",92.65,92.87],["painting?",92.87,93.23]]},{"start":93.93,"end":99.47,"text":"It's interesting how a lot of artists you can see how their style is developing as their","words":[["It's",93.93,94.31],["interesting",94.31,94.81],["how",94.81,95.21],["a",95.21,95.57],["lot",95.57,95.77],["of",95.77,95.93],["artists",95.93,96.39],["you",96.39,96.77],["can",96.77,96.97],["see",96.97,97.27],["how",97.27,97.55],["their",97.55,97.79],["style",97.79,98.21],["is",98.21,98.41],["developing",98.41,98.91],["as",98.91,99.29],["their",99.29,99.47]]},{"start":99.47,"end":105.81,"text":"work matures, but not so much with Prout. He seems to have several on the go all at","words":[["work",99.47,99.81],["matures,",99.81,100.33],["but",101.09,101.35],["not",101.35,101.75],["so",101.75,101.99],["much",101.99,102.27],["with",102.27,102.49],["Prout.",102.49,102.89],["He",103.51,103.81],["seems",103.81,104.19],["to",104.19,104.43],["have",104.43,104.63],["several",104.63,104.99],["on",104.99,105.21],["the",105.21,105.31],["go",105.31,105.49],["all",105.49,105.69],["at",105.69,105.81]]},{"start":105.81,"end":113.95,"text":"same time. Yes, with others you can say, oh that must be by so and so and painted in around 1820 say.","words":[["same",105.81,106.09],["time.",106.09,106.49],["Yes,",106.83,107.09],["with",107.47,107.65],["others",107.65,107.97],["you",107.97,108.25],["can",108.25,108.39],["say,",108.39,108.63],["oh",109.03,109.37],["that",109.37,109.67],["must",109.67,110.09],["be",110.09,110.39],["by",110.39,110.67],["so",110.67,110.97],["and",110.97,111.11],["so",111.11,111.35],["and",111.35,111.69],["painted",111.69,112.13],["in",112.13,112.39],["around",112.39,112.69],["1820",112.69,113.59],["say.",113.59,113.95]]},{"start":114.35,"end":121.05,"text":"Right but not so much with Prout. Of course Prout's career had a huge boost when the art critic","words":[["Right",114.35,114.61],["but",114.61,115.01],["not",115.01,115.35],["so",115.35,115.61],["much",115.61,115.91],["with",115.91,116.13],["Prout.",116.13,116.45],["Of",116.97,117.57],["course",117.57,117.77],["Prout's",117.77,118.33],["career",118.33,118.65],["had",118.65,118.87],["a",118.87,119.01],["huge",119.01,119.33],["boost",119.33,119.81],["when",119.81,120.11],["the",120.11,120.33],["art",120.33,120.59],["critic",120.59,121.05]]},{"start":121.05,"end":126.75,"text":"John Ruskin declared him a great artist. Yes but Ruskin's assessment was quite biased,","words":[["John",121.05,121.49],["Ruskin",121.49,121.99],["declared",121.99,122.31],["him",122.31,122.69],["a",122.69,122.81],["great",122.81,123.11],["artist.",123.11,123.61],["Yes",124.13,124.41],["but",124.41,124.69],["Ruskin's",124.69,125.25],["assessment",125.25,125.67],["was",125.67,125.97],["quite",125.97,126.27],["biased,",126.27,126.75]]},{"start":126.89,"end":133.15,"text":"wasn't it? How do you mean? Well, Ruskin admired Prout and he didn't seem to mind the fact","words":[["wasn't",126.89,127.21],["it?",127.21,127.43],["How",127.81,128.07],["do",128.07,128.23],["you",128.23,128.31],["mean?",128.31,128.51],["Well,",128.99,129.33],["Ruskin",129.69,130.03],["admired",130.03,130.29],["Prout",130.29,131.07],["and",131.07,131.57],["he",131.57,131.79],["didn't",131.79,132.05],["seem",132.05,132.23],["to",132.23,132.39],["mind",132.39,132.69],["the",132.69,132.93],["fact",132.93,133.15]]},{"start":133.15,"end":138.87,"text":"that many of his paintings showed more or less the same thing, European street scenes,","words":[["that",133.15,133.31],["many",133.31,133.65],["of",133.65,133.81],["his",133.81,133.93],["paintings",133.93,134.35],["showed",134.35,134.87],["more",134.87,135.27],["or",135.27,135.43],["less",135.43,135.67],["the",135.67,135.85],["same",135.85,136.19],["thing,",136.19,136.55],["European",137.21,137.63],["street",137.63,138.25],["scenes,",138.25,138.87]]},{"start":139.59,"end":144.67,"text":"or that the people in Prout's pictures can look rather wooden and not very lifelike.","words":[["or",139.59,139.85],["that",139.85,140.03],["the",140.03,140.21],["people",140.21,140.53],["in",140.53,140.75],["Prout's",140.75,141.13],["pictures",141.13,141.53],["can",141.53,141.91],["look",141.91,142.13],["rather",142.13,142.39],["wooden",142.39,142.79],["and",142.79,143.27],["not",143.27,143.59],["very",143.59,143.89],["lifelike.",143.89,144.67]]},{"start":144.95,"end":149.39,"text":"For me, his detailing of architecture was too predictable.","words":[["For",144.95,145.17],["me,",145.17,145.45],["his",145.93,146.21],["detailing",146.21,146.91],["of",146.91,147.23],["architecture",147.23,147.81],["was",147.81,148.33],["too",148.33,148.67],["predictable.",148.67,149.39]]},{"start":150.01,"end":154.13,"text":"But for Ruskin, that was where Prout's genius lay.","words":[["But",150.01,150.37],["for",150.37,150.79],["Ruskin,",150.79,151.35],["that",151.87,152.19],["was",152.19,152.43],["where",152.43,152.65],["Prout's",152.65,153.25],["genius",153.25,153.59],["lay.",153.59,154.13]]},{"start":154.45,"end":157.89,"text":"Well, I guess that's what Ruskin was particularly interested in.","words":[["Well,",154.45,154.75],["I",154.95,155.09],["guess",155.09,155.31],["that's",155.31,155.71],["what",155.71,155.83],["Ruskin",155.83,156.25],["was",156.25,156.43],["particularly",156.43,156.97],["interested",156.97,157.59],["in.",157.59,157.89]]},{"start":160.71,"end":166.85,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 26","words":[["Before",160.71,161.79],["you",161.79,162.09],["hear",162.09,162.35],["the",162.35,162.51],["rest",162.51,162.79],["of",162.79,162.93],["the",162.93,163.01],["discussion,",163.01,163.43],["you",163.97,164.17],["have",164.17,164.37],["some",164.37,164.59],["time",164.59,165.05],["to",165.05,165.33],["look",165.33,165.47],["at",165.47,165.61],["questions",165.61,165.89],["26",165.89,166.85]]},{"start":166.85,"end":197.66,"text":"to 30 on page 6. Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30.","words":[["to",166.85,167.05],["30",167.05,167.39],["on",167.39,168.07],["page",168.07,168.41],["6.",168.41,168.93],["Now",194.36,194.68],["listen",194.68,194.98],["and",194.98,195.42],["answer",195.42,195.82],["questions",195.82,196.22],["26",196.22,197.12],["to",197.12,197.32],["30.",197.32,197.66]]},{"start":200.96,"end":207.38,"text":"Okay Jack, so your brief was to prepare a presentation to give to the group and show","words":[["Okay",200.96,201.6],["Jack,",201.6,201.92],["so",202.36,202.56],["your",202.56,202.98],["brief",202.98,203.36],["was",203.36,203.66],["to",203.66,203.96],["prepare",203.96,204.38],["a",204.38,204.6],["presentation",204.6,205.04],["to",205.04,205.6],["give",205.6,205.78],["to",205.78,205.96],["the",205.96,206.08],["group",206.08,206.42],["and",206.42,207.12],["show",207.12,207.38]]},{"start":207.38,"end":213.08,"text":"some pictures associated with the artist, each of which makes a key point about their","words":[["some",207.38,207.66],["pictures",207.66,208.12],["associated",208.12,208.96],["with",208.96,209.48],["the",209.48,209.62],["artist,",209.62,210.16],["each",210.4,210.96],["of",210.96,211.12],["which",211.12,211.42],["makes",211.42,211.72],["a",211.72,211.94],["key",211.94,212.18],["point",212.18,212.58],["about",212.58,212.86],["their",212.86,213.08]]},{"start":213.08,"end":214.02,"text":"work, okay?","words":[["work,",213.08,213.48],["okay?",213.7,214.02]]},{"start":214.02,"end":221.24,"text":"Right. Well, I wanted to start with a view in Germany at Würzburg. It's a detailed","words":[["Right.",214.02,214.76],["Well,",215.32,215.86],["I",216.04,216.18],["wanted",216.18,216.44],["to",216.44,216.68],["start",216.68,216.96],["with",216.96,217.3],["a",217.3,217.68],["view",217.68,217.92],["in",217.92,218.14],["Germany",218.14,218.62],["at",218.62,219.16],["Würzburg.",219.16,219.74],["It's",220.32,220.76],["a",220.76,220.86],["detailed",220.86,221.24]]},{"start":221.24,"end":226.18,"text":"watercolor showing a busy market scene with a background of flamboyant detail","words":[["watercolor",221.24,221.88],["showing",221.88,222.36],["a",222.36,222.62],["busy",222.62,222.84],["market",222.84,223.36],["scene",223.36,223.8],["with",223.8,224.16],["a",224.16,224.3],["background",224.3,224.72],["of",224.72,224.96],["flamboyant",224.96,225.68],["detail",225.68,226.18]]},{"start":226.18,"end":231.38,"text":"like in so many of his pictures. Yes, basically what Prout had made his name","words":[["like",226.18,226.58],["in",226.58,226.78],["so",226.78,226.96],["many",226.96,227.2],["of",227.2,227.38],["his",227.38,227.5],["pictures.",227.5,227.86],["Yes,",228.38,228.66],["basically",229.12,229.68],["what",229.68,229.98],["Prout",229.98,230.38],["had",230.38,230.66],["made",230.66,230.84],["his",230.84,231.1],["name",231.1,231.38]]},{"start":231.38,"end":237.06,"text":"doing so well. It really gives the flavour of his work. Right. Okay. There's a","words":[["doing",231.38,231.68],["so",231.68,232.04],["well.",232.04,232.42],["It",232.9,233.1],["really",233.1,233.52],["gives",233.52,233.84],["the",233.84,234.08],["flavour",234.08,234.64],["of",234.64,234.88],["his",234.88,235.02],["work.",235.02,235.34],["Right.",235.46,235.78],["Okay.",235.92,236.26],["There's",236.62,237.0],["a",237.0,237.06]]},{"start":237.06,"end":241.54,"text":"painting called Bridge on the Ooze near York. Except that experts now","words":[["painting",237.06,237.34],["called",237.34,237.72],["Bridge",237.72,238.1],["on",238.1,238.3],["the",238.3,238.46],["Ooze",238.46,238.82],["near",238.82,239.08],["York.",239.08,239.48],["Except",240.02,240.52],["that",240.52,240.82],["experts",240.82,241.12],["now",241.12,241.54]]},{"start":241.54,"end":244.88,"text":"think this isn't York at all, but somewhere in the south of England.","words":[["think",241.54,241.78],["this",241.78,242.02],["isn't",242.02,242.34],["York",242.34,242.58],["at",242.58,242.8],["all,",242.8,243.18],["but",243.46,243.62],["somewhere",243.62,243.94],["in",243.94,244.14],["the",244.14,244.24],["south",244.24,244.46],["of",244.46,244.66],["England.",244.66,244.88]]},{"start":245.22,"end":245.62,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",245.22,245.62]]},{"start":246.16,"end":249.14,"text":"But as far as I know, the picture has never been renamed.","words":[["But",246.16,246.38],["as",246.38,246.56],["far",246.56,246.82],["as",246.82,246.98],["I",246.98,247.1],["know,",247.1,247.38],["the",247.7,247.76],["picture",247.76,248.06],["has",248.06,248.24],["never",248.24,248.44],["been",248.44,248.7],["renamed.",248.7,249.14]]},{"start":249.72,"end":254.56,"text":"No, that would make cataloging and researching Prout's pictures more complicated.","words":[["No,",249.72,250.16],["that",250.38,250.6],["would",250.6,250.72],["make",250.72,250.96],["cataloging",250.96,251.8],["and",251.8,251.96],["researching",251.96,252.5],["Prout's",252.5,253.02],["pictures",253.02,253.36],["more",253.36,253.78],["complicated.",253.78,254.56]]},{"start":255.16,"end":261.44,"text":"And the next one is called Woodland Scene. This one has a signature. It says S Prout","words":[["And",255.16,255.42],["the",255.42,255.56],["next",255.56,255.9],["one",255.9,256.14],["is",256.14,256.42],["called",256.42,256.66],["Woodland",256.66,257.26],["Scene.",257.26,257.74],["This",258.52,258.84],["one",258.84,259.08],["has",259.08,259.28],["a",259.28,259.4],["signature.",259.4,259.8],["It",260.18,260.26],["says",260.26,260.46],["S",260.46,260.96],["Prout",260.96,261.44]]},{"start":261.44,"end":267.54,"text":"in the bottom left. But even so, experts on Prout say they doubt he actually painted","words":[["in",261.44,261.88],["the",261.88,262.0],["bottom",262.0,262.22],["left.",262.22,262.64],["But",263.16,263.48],["even",263.48,263.96],["so,",263.96,264.32],["experts",264.54,264.9],["on",264.9,265.24],["Prout",265.24,265.56],["say",265.56,265.92],["they",265.92,266.12],["doubt",266.12,266.44],["he",266.44,266.74],["actually",266.74,267.16],["painted",267.16,267.54]]},{"start":267.54,"end":267.84,"text":"it.","words":[["it.",267.54,267.84]]},{"start":267.84,"end":275.9,"text":"Yes, I remember reading that. The detailing is too clumsy, with the sun not casting shade","words":[["Yes,",267.84,268.46],["I",268.66,268.9],["remember",268.9,269.3],["reading",269.3,269.86],["that.",269.86,270.3],["The",270.94,271.18],["detailing",271.18,271.86],["is",271.86,272.18],["too",272.18,272.5],["clumsy,",272.5,273.2],["with",273.84,274.12],["the",274.12,274.3],["sun",274.3,274.68],["not",274.68,274.96],["casting",274.96,275.46],["shade",275.46,275.9]]},{"start":275.9,"end":276.9,"text":"in the right place.","words":[["in",275.9,276.18],["the",276.18,276.28],["right",276.28,276.5],["place.",276.5,276.9]]},{"start":277.68,"end":282.98,"text":"Exactly, and there's a lot of blue that basically doesn't appear in any other Prout pictures.","words":[["Exactly,",277.68,278.18],["and",278.6,278.92],["there's",278.92,279.24],["a",279.24,279.34],["lot",279.34,279.48],["of",279.48,279.64],["blue",279.64,280.0],["that",280.0,280.32],["basically",280.32,280.8],["doesn't",280.8,281.32],["appear",281.32,281.64],["in",281.64,281.86],["any",281.86,282.06],["other",282.06,282.22],["Prout",282.22,282.5],["pictures.",282.5,282.98]]},{"start":283.54,"end":285.32,"text":"So it's probably a forgery?","words":[["So",283.54,283.88],["it's",283.88,284.34],["probably",284.34,284.74],["a",284.74,284.96],["forgery?",284.96,285.32]]},{"start":285.72,"end":288.88,"text":"Yes. And what's the next one?","words":[["Yes.",285.72,286.18],["And",287.06,287.5],["what's",287.5,288.02],["the",288.02,288.2],["next",288.2,288.56],["one?",288.56,288.88]]},{"start":289.66,"end":297.32,"text":"Venice. It's a view from the Grand Canal, with some rather grand buildings. They're","words":[["Venice.",289.66,290.08],["It's",290.88,291.24],["a",291.24,291.32],["view",291.32,291.56],["from",291.56,291.86],["the",291.86,292.04],["Grand",292.04,292.26],["Canal,",292.26,292.72],["with",293.12,293.36],["some",293.36,293.66],["rather",293.66,293.9],["grand",293.9,294.26],["buildings.",294.26,294.92],["They're",296.6,297.32]]},{"start":297.32,"end":302.52,"text":"sort of picturesque shadow cast by the building's opposite, which is shown brilliantly.","words":[["sort",297.32,297.48],["of",297.48,297.76],["picturesque",297.76,298.6],["shadow",298.6,299.14],["cast",299.14,299.6],["by",299.6,299.86],["the",299.86,299.98],["building's",299.98,300.4],["opposite,",300.4,300.64],["which",301.16,301.42],["is",301.42,301.62],["shown",301.62,301.92],["brilliantly.",301.92,302.52]]},{"start":303.42,"end":307.5,"text":"Lovely use of colour. Proud at his best, I think.","words":[["Lovely",303.42,304.02],["use",304.02,304.6],["of",304.6,304.8],["colour.",304.8,305.14],["Proud",305.74,306.06],["at",306.06,306.38],["his",306.38,306.64],["best,",306.64,307.06],["I",307.16,307.3],["think.",307.3,307.5]]},{"start":307.82,"end":311.4,"text":"Right. And then there's entrance to a harbour.","words":[["Right.",307.82,308.18],["And",308.94,309.42],["then",309.42,309.7],["there's",309.7,310.1],["entrance",310.1,310.54],["to",310.54,310.92],["a",310.92,311.06],["harbour.",311.06,311.4]]},{"start":311.74,"end":314.64,"text":"Right. He grew up by the sea, didn't he?","words":[["Right.",311.74,312.24],["He",312.46,312.6],["grew",312.6,312.98],["up",312.98,313.28],["by",313.28,313.54],["the",313.54,313.74],["sea,",313.74,314.04],["didn't",314.1,314.42],["he?",314.42,314.64]]},{"start":314.92,"end":322.34,"text":"Yes, in Plymouth. He didn't specialise in seascapes, but this same location with the harbour and the sea","words":[["Yes,",314.92,315.3],["in",315.54,315.64],["Plymouth.",315.64,316.0],["He",316.9,317.06],["didn't",317.06,317.36],["specialise",317.36,318.16],["in",318.16,318.34],["seascapes,",318.34,319.1],["but",319.2,319.58],["this",319.58,319.86],["same",319.86,320.16],["location",320.16,320.68],["with",320.68,321.12],["the",321.12,321.3],["harbour",321.3,321.66],["and",321.66,321.88],["the",321.88,322.06],["sea",322.06,322.34]]},{"start":322.34,"end":328.24,"text":"also appear in other pictures showing a range of weather conditions they don't","words":[["also",322.34,323.12],["appear",323.12,323.52],["in",323.52,323.72],["other",323.72,323.92],["pictures",323.92,324.4],["showing",324.4,325.16],["a",325.16,325.36],["range",325.36,325.72],["of",325.72,325.92],["weather",325.92,326.14],["conditions",326.14,326.76],["they",326.76,327.9],["don't",327.9,328.24]]},{"start":328.24,"end":333.98,"text":"all have figures like this one but I think they're really well done right well","words":[["all",328.24,328.62],["have",328.62,328.88],["figures",328.88,329.26],["like",329.26,329.62],["this",329.62,329.86],["one",329.86,330.12],["but",330.12,330.74],["I",330.74,331.2],["think",331.2,331.34],["they're",331.34,331.58],["really",331.58,331.82],["well",331.82,332.06],["done",332.06,332.38],["right",332.38,333.1],["well",333.1,333.98]]},{"start":333.98,"end":342.61,"text":"now you've obviously that is the end of section three you now have half a minute","words":[["now",333.98,334.2],["you've",334.2,334.54],["obviously",334.54,334.9],["that",334.9,335.88],["is",338.67,338.89],["the",338.89,339.05],["end",339.05,339.41],["of",339.41,339.61],["section",339.61,339.87],["three",339.87,340.41],["you",340.41,341.37],["now",341.37,341.61],["have",341.61,341.95],["half",341.95,342.27],["a",342.27,342.41],["minute",342.41,342.61]]},{"start":342.61,"end":343.69,"text":"to check your answers","words":[["to",342.61,342.89],["check",342.89,343.15],["your",343.15,343.35],["answers",343.35,343.69]]}]}